Type a word containing punctuation, then erase by word (^W). The word scan in
ctlw lands on the '.' rune, exercising the ASCII-punctuation branch of alnum.

-- input --
type foo.bar
key ctrl-w
-- waitframes --
29 33 37 41 45 49 53 57 61
-- drawops --
JIqbbAbddbbbbdbbbbdbbbYbilbbd{5}bbd{30}lddxddlddxddddxddlddxddlddxddlddxddlddxd{10}
